{"parent":"article.new-luciana.json","context":{"market":"france"},"sections":{"rich_text_bDPEf":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p>At William Wood, we believe in the beauty of simplicity and elegance. Our Luciana mirror has been a longstanding favourite, admired for their unique design and modern elegance. <\/p><p><\/p><p>Today, we’re excited to introduce a range of new sizes to this beloved design- bringing its timeless appeal for spaces both large and small in your home. <\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","background_type":"full_width","text_width":"medium","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","header-4eefecc2e040d3c362836c7e4acb0e25":null,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","button_text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{},"block_order":[]},"slideshow_N9PeQ":{"type":"slideshow","disabled":false,"settings":{"section_height":"auto","transition_type":"sweep","autoplay":true,"cycle_speed":5,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"image_tNzXN":{"type":"image","disabled":false,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Luciana_Merge.jpg","split_image":null,"mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Luciana_Concrete_Arch_Full_Length_Extra_Large_mirror_cblovesinteriors.jpg","header-bc51549471269f76bc1f94ec81526c48":null,"text_position":"middle_center","subheading":"","title":"Design Process","button_1_text":"","button_1_link":"","button_2_text":"","button_2_link":"","header-c122d4a0302704c922413794b7d8d961":null,"text_color":"#ffffff","button_background":"#ffffff","button_text_color":"#000000","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":30}}},"block_order":["image_tNzXN"]},"rich_text_k9WXU":{"type":"rich-text","disabled":false,"settings":{"subheading":"","title":"","content":"<p>The Luciana design made waves when it first launched, with its popularity portrayed in numerous restocks for our loyal customers. We have been thrilled to see its